cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pipeline, please cite it as below."
title: "meta-analysis-dual-coder: dual-LLM independent coding and third-party adjudication for meta-analysis data extraction"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible pipeline that has two independent large language models code the same
  corpus against a fixed coding manual, then adjudicates field-level disagreements with a
  third model under blinding, including an audit of agreeing cells to estimate shared error.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-19"
license: MIT
type: software
